{"id":"4e9b7bbf60770182","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Almost Disjoint Family","display":"df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Comb5 Almost Disjoint Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Comb5 Almost Disjoint Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-disjoint]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Comb5 Almost Disjoint Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" href=\"?note=17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" title=\"58-df-disjoint\">58-df-disjoint</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}|\">\\(|{-}|\\)</span> is the cardinality operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[X]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to|A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[X]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to|A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Members are required to be countably infinite; finite members would make the pairwise-finite-intersection clause vacuous.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-disjoint","status":"resolved","id":"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-disjoint]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|{-}|$ is the cardinality operator (see [[58-df-cardinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"|{-}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[X]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to|A\\cap B|<\\omega)","display":true}],"bytes":1293,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1650","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-almost-disjoint-family]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","17c8f9ebc93d5a7a","545b51e7aa011030","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}